WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.499
Carabas looked around his house.

2
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.928
"I need money," he thought.

3
00:00:13.929 --> 00:00:21.125
"Maybe I can sell something."

4
00:00:21.126 --> 00:00:26.184
Just then Puss walked in with a gold coin.

5
00:00:26.185 --> 00:00:32.809
Carabas gasped. "Where did you get that?"

6
00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:36.902
Puss shrugged. "The king gave it to me."

7
00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:42.400
Carabas scratched his head. "The king?"

8
00:00:42.401 --> 00:00:46.584
Puss nodded. "He and I are friends."

9
00:00:46.585 --> 00:00:52.344
Puss gave Carabas the gold coin.

10
00:00:52.345 --> 00:00:55.963
"Oh, Puss! Thank you!" Carabas said.

11
00:00:55.964 --> 00:01:01.322
Puss laughed and nodded.

12
00:01:01.323 --> 00:01:08.616
"More good things will happen soon."

13
00:01:08.617 --> 00:01:13.569
Puss visited the king every day.

14
00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:16.951
He brought a gift every day too.

15
00:01:16.952 --> 00:01:21.240
"From the duke," he said.

16
00:01:21.241 --> 00:01:24.482
The king loved Puss.

17
00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:28.660
A singer sang for the cat.

18
00:01:28.661 --> 00:01:33.195
A jester juggled for him.

19
00:01:33.196 --> 00:01:37.593
One day Puss and the king had lunch.

20
00:01:37.594 --> 00:01:40.579
"Tell me about the duke," the king said.

21
00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.505
"Is he kind? Is he handsome?"

22
00:01:43.506 --> 00:01:48.712
Puss smiled. "The duke is honest and kind."

23
00:01:48.713 --> 00:01:52.478
"Is he neat?" the king asked.

24
00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:55.080
"Oh yes," Puss said.

25
00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:58.224
"He's rich and dresses very well."

26
00:01:58.225 --> 00:02:01.396
"Excellent!" the king said.

27
00:02:01.397 --> 00:02:03.503
"I want to meet him."

28
00:02:03.504 --> 00:02:06.097
Puss gulped.

29
00:02:06.098 --> 00:02:08.230
"Uh-oh," he thought.

30
00:02:08.231 --> 00:02:10.460
"I can't bring Carabas here.

31
00:02:10.461 --> 00:02:14.061
The king will see that he is poor!"

32
00:02:14.062 --> 00:02:16.360
Puss thought fast.

33
00:02:16.361 --> 00:02:20.460
"My master is, um, very busy right now.

34
00:02:20.461 --> 00:02:26.431
I'm sure you can meet him soon, though."

